              4 (1943) 610-627 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1969099"}> doi:10.2307/1969099
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On representing twisted
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eilenberg%E2%80%93MacLane+spaces"} Eilenberg–MacLane spaces
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology+operations"} cohomology operations
            for twisted ordinary cohomology:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Samuel+Gitler"}> Samuel Gitler
                ,
                = succeed "," do
