                2 (1963) 156–188 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.2307/2373208"}> doi:10.2307/2373208
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                M. Bullejos, E. Faro, M. A. García-Muñoz,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Homotopy colimits and cohomology with local coefficients
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=CTGDC_2003__44_1_63_0"} numdam:CTGDC_2003__44_1_63_0
          %p
            The case of twisted
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+%28Eilenberg-Steenrod%29+cohomology"} generalized (Eilenberg-Steenrod) cohomology
            twisted by a
            = succeed "-" do
