                %em Twisted stable homotopy theory
                PhD thesis 2005 (
                %a{:href => "http://dspace.mit.edu/handle/1721.1/7582"}> dspace:1721.1/7582
                )
          %p
            This in turn is based on the definition of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+K-theory"} twisted K-theory
            given in
          %ul
